#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0082 expect=violation domain=AE
#note "AEBDSYCD column absent. Requirements.Variables.All [--BODSYS, --BDSYCD] (owner, 2026-10-02) skips the record-level rule instead of reading the absent column as all-missing and firing once per populated AEBODSYS record. The absence itself is reported once per dataset by the sister CDISC-CG9685 (CDISC-CG9685-violation_no_bdsycd_column-AE pins the same rows)."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#expectViolationCount 1
dataset AE class=EVENTS label="Adverse Events"
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col AESEQ    type=Num
col AETERM   type=Char
col AEBODSYS type=Char
---
S1 | AE | 001 | 1 | HEADACHE | Nervous system disorders
S1 | AE | 001 | 2 | NAUSEA   | Gastrointestinal disorders
---
